cause I will  over explain and overanalyze is not  because I wish to like  surebut because i want people to  understand what it is that I'm saying  and I'd like to think that at the end of  the day even if you ultimately come to  the conclusion that you don't agree with  what I'm saying if you can understand  why it is that I'm saying it and the  thought process I have behind it that  maybe if nothing else we can come to a  greater level of respect for each  other's views and opinions because I can  demonstrate that I'm not just banging an  ethos from these thoughts these ideas  they come from places and they come from  you know there is a thought process I  tried very hard to not just parrot stuff  that I've heard and I'm not perfect I'm  sure especially if you go back to before  I had the sort of the same attention to  detail and these things that I tend to  have now I just probably is this is  where I said something that I probably  didn't put enough thought into or look  and do well enough before I said it but  I try and be cautious about that now and  I hope that my doing so can just get  people to understand me my thoughts and  maybe even other people who are like me  in some way a little bit better so we'll  stop there thank you very much for  watching there are a whole bunch of  links found in the description including  the patreon plus a link to the book if  you're at all interested so I will wrap  it up on that one folks remember you're  beautiful you are loved you are valid  you are the council and I just run the  meetings so until next time this council  is adjourned  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

